d=\"Picture 47\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p28576/image071.png\"></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2310;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367; (X) &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344;&#2367;&#2361;&#2367;&#2340; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404; (&#2328;&#2369;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2350;&#2340;&#2367; &#2361;&#2376;)</p><p><img width=198 height=141 id=\"Picture 46\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p28576/image070.png\"></p><p><img width=179 height=573 id=\"Picture 47\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p28576/image071.png\"></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">I</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">I</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">II</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">II</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">III</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">III</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">IV</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">IV</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>When option figure (II) rotated 90&deg; clockwise we get:</p><p><img width=54 height=108 id=\"Picture 49\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p28576/image072.png\"></p><p>Figure (II) is embedded in the given figure (X). </p><p><img width=193 height=144 id=\"Picture 51\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p28576/image073.png\"></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the option figures when rotated 90&deg; Anti-clockwise and then 270&deg; clockwise will result in the given question figure?</p><p><img width=680 height=371 id=\"Picture 47\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20110/image041.png\" alt=2.png></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2310;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2379; 90&deg; &#2357;&#2366;&#2350;&#2366;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340; &#2324;&#2352; &#2347;&#2367;&#2352; 270&deg; &#2342;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2339;&#2366;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340; &#2328;&#2369;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2346;&#2352; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2310;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2368;?</p><p><img width=\"680\" height=\"371\" id=\"Picture 47\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20110/image041.png\" alt=\"2.png\"></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">II</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">II</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">IV</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">IV</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">III</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">III</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">I</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">I</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>After rotating the given figure by 270&deg; Anti-clockwise manner and then further rotating 90&deg; in the clockwise manner then the resulting figure will be 180 anti-clock wise.</p><p>90&deg; in the anti-clockwise manner:</p><p><img width=166 height=229 id=\"Picture 45\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20110/image042.png\" alt=2.png></p><p>90&deg; anti-clockwise manners:</p><p><img width=208 height=163 id=\"Picture 46\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20110/image043.png\" alt=2.png></p><p>So, Option figure (III) is correct.</p>","marks":2,"section":null}]}